      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to add more to the Analytics request:\n\nWe need to know:\n\n- Player platform usage: IS desktop using it more than VR, Do VR people instantly change out of it for any reason\n\n- Performance and Hardware: Are quest players getting lower frames, do they need more tuning, are certain brands of GPUs having issues, is desktop performance worse than VR?\n\n- Avatar usage: Is a majority of usage repeat players or 1 time users\n\n- - what customization settings did they use in the expression menu?\n\n- Location: Is a majority of users from Japan or Mexico? \n\n- - Should I release a European or Latin style?\n\n- - Should I design the next avatar targeting my Latin user base?\n\n- - Should I spend time to add multilingual options to the Expression menu?\n\n- Player Feedback: Did the players like or dislike the avatar, what was their total time at review",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
